# GitHub Pages

- Static: Vite `dist/`. Source: **GitHub Actions** (niet branch/docs).
- URL: `https://<owner>.github.io/Reaction-game/`
- Vite: `base: '/Reaction-game/'`

## Workflow

`.github/workflows/deploy-pages.yml`

- Triggers: push `main`, `workflow_dispatch`
- Perms: `contents: read`, `pages: write`, `id-token: write`
- Concurrency groep tegen overlap
- Stappen: `npm ci` → `npm test` → typecheck → `npm run build` → artifact → deploy
- Rode tests/typecheck/build = geen deploy

## Routing

Prefer hash of single-route. Path-routes → Pages-fallback (`404.html` ≈ `index.html`).

Na wijzigingen: `base`, asset-URLs en SW-scope controleren.
